<!--
    Launcher shortcut icon: JHT (the job hunt). A briefcase: a body, plus a handle drawn as
    three bars rather than an outline, so every sub-path is a clockwise rectangle and the
    non-zero fill rule unions them instead of punching holes.
    White fill: the launcher tints and masks it (see ic_shortcut_flow.xml).
-->
